A||||5||prof bobo||2Q's: fr sus & intake 'box'||||1||
Z||000000||prof bobo||09-26-2000||03:47 PM||||Hey y'all, I got 2 simple questions:<P>In removing all of the front suspension parts  on my '85 GT I discovered that the holes in rear lower control arm mounts (the bracket on the frame through which the BIG bolt passes) have rusted and appear enlarged.  The bracket seems free of rust, just the hole has gotten bigger ('bout the size of a US nickel).  Is this cause for concern?  Can I just weld another piece of steel over/to it and re-drill it?<P>I've got all the body panels off the car (actually I'm stripping it to the bone to fix some frame rust and repaint) and am getting ready to drop the gas tank.  In taking the filler neck out I'm looking at the air intake duct, wondering what's the deal with the big plastic box before the duct enters the air cleaner can.  Does this thing do something useful, or just restrict the airflow?<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Phil||09-26-2000||06:51 PM||||I't a water separator and according to flow tests it is not restrictive. If you remove it you will not get a HP gain just a hissing sound when you drive.||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||09-26-2000||07:17 PM||||If you're describing what I think you are on the lower arm. yes you could patch it. You have to get some measurments on where to drill the new hole. If it's off you could bind the arm, screw up alignment so it can't be adjusted into spec, or both.||||reg||1
Z||000003||prof bobo||09-29-2000||06:57 AM||||Thanks for the info/advice.  Re the control arm mount: I'm thinkin' since the front mount is fine, and the front half of the rear mount, I should be able to run a straight rod through both to locate/center the 'rearest' hole.  Wouldn't you agree?||||reg||1
Z||000004||WKDFIRO||09-29-2000||08:30 AM||||Who did flow testing on the air box? What were the numbers like? It seems to be simply a muffler more than a water seperator.||||reg||1
Z||000005||theogre||09-29-2000||08:31 AM||||It does both.<P>It's mostly a matter of personal preference. I don't think it makse much diferance if it's there or not.||||reg||1
